Standard runway-dependent airplanes have limited use in missions right now, mainly because most islands are too small for takeoff and landing, and missions take place at sea where there is no runway to land. As such, aircraft in Stormworks tend to be [[Wiki/Guides/Seaplanes|seaplanes]].

Airplanes generate lift by using [[Wiki/Building/Components/Vehicle Control#Wing_Front_Section|wings]]. More information on [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lift_(force) Wikipedia].

You need to place the wings like this to create lift:
[[File:Wing Lift.jpg|frameless|150px]]


Read [[Wiki/Guides/Airplanes|how to build an airplane]].

